        { ar: 'lda_predict: [0 if lda_score(x, pi0, mu0) >= lda_score(x, pi1, mu1) else 1 for x in xs] — التعادل >= يعطي الصنف 0.', en: 'lda_predict: [0 if lda_score(x, pi0, mu0) >= lda_score(x, pi1, mu1) else 1 for x in xs] — the >= tie rule gives class 0.' },
